{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-common-biology-22","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"biology","number":22,"points":null,"unitId":"neuro","unitLabel":"신경·근육·감각","topic":"뉴런·활동전위","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["neuro","gene","signaling","development"],"stem":"사람은약350여종류의냄새분자수용체유전자를가지고있으나\n3,000～30,000 가지의냄새를구별할수있는것으로알려져있다.\n사람의후각계가적은수의유전자로많은종류의냄새를구별하는\n방법으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 여러종류의냄새분자가한종류의수용체와결합한다.\nㄴ. 후각수용체뉴런에서는냄새분자의종류에따라시간적\n활동전위발생패턴이다르게나타난다.\nㄷ. 한종류의냄새분자가여러종류의수용체와결합하고이들\n정보가조합을이루어냄새를인식한다.\nㄹ. 후각수용체뉴런은발생과정에서유전자의재조합을통하여\n많은종류의수용체분자를발현한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":779,"height":362,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,93.268,311.6,144.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-22/01.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":12,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.732,416.5,442.1],"width":333.756,"height":289.368,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.056,93.268,311.6,144.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"22. 사람은약350여종류의냄새분자수용체유전자를가지고있으나","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"22.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.401,11.995],"origin":[5.0,14.596],"size":11.687,"flags":0,"font":"T1"},{"text":" 사람은","bbox":[21.401,5.768,36.148,11.155],"origin":[21.401,14.596],"size":10.752,"flags":0,"font":"T9"},{"text":"약","bbox":[61.458,5.888,10.477,11.035],"origin":[